Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:26.13,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.47,0:00:34.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.43,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,My father's stories of the past \Njust never run dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:40.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You must be tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:42.61,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,There are so many guests here \Nfor the wedding as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:43.61,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.03,0:00:46.86,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's lovely to have so many \Npeople congratulating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:50.61,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I am truly blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.25,0:00:54.37,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I have a present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:55.29,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.29,0:00:57.69,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.89,0:01:03.92,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's in your color.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:07.17,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so happy to receive this. \NIt's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:08.71,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.71,0:01:11.56,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I actually designed this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.48,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:14.47,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It took some time to complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:16.87,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm glad I was able to \Ngive it to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.31,0:01:19.66,Italics,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua did all that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:22.20,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,May I put it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:23.20,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:28.16,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes, it suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:31.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you, Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.63,0:01:33.66,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I mean, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.94,0:01:36.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:41.77,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.94,0:01:45.22,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You feel so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:47.92,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I could touch you like this forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:50.92,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I never get tired of it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:53.04,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.66,0:01:55.39,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,like husband, like wife, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:07.24,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Mom, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:08.32,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.67,0:02:32.38,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:50.00,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(560,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\b1\pos(320,123)\c&H343E6B&\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25}A {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Love{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Like {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Ripples{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}on the Water
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.00,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:54.66,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,That dress looks lovely on you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:56.38,Default,Seamstress,0,0,0,,Yes, it truly does!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:04:01.35,Default,Seamstress,0,0,0,,To be entrusted with making dresses \Nfor Lady Tiararose, our future queen...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:03.98,Default,Seamstress,0,0,0,,How lucky I am to be a designer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.98,0:04:06.52,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you... but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:08.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I think you've made a few too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:10.66,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:14.60,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,You'll have many new duties as a consort! \NThis isn't even enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:16.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:20.57,Default,Seamstress,0,0,0,,You know, they say there's something \Nstrange about the sea recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:22.16,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.57,0:04:25.64,Default,Seamstress,0,0,0,,Yes. I haven't seen it myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.42,Default,Seamstress,0,0,0,,but I hear its color is \Na bit different from usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.42,0:04:31.08,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I wonder if something's \Nhappened to the sea fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:35.40,Default,Seamstress,0,0,0,,You're right. It could be \Nthe sea fairies playing a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:40.59,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:42.19,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What a great success!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.19,0:04:44.54,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Something smells nice, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:50.07,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.07,0:04:52.48,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:55.32,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I love my husband so, so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:58.83,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm the only one in the world \Nwho gets to see this expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:02.61,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,We've lived together for a year, \Nand our wedding is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.58,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,but he still makes my heart race.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:11.24,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I see you made the cookies I asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:14.71,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes. I tried making them in animal shapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.71,0:05:15.92,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:17.45,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.45,0:05:20.92,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Ah, no. Would you like to taste one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:22.22,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:33.00,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Just this once, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.07,0:05:39.32,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.32,0:05:42.91,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Well, you're sweeter \Nthan any cookie, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:45.54,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, please... You're embarrassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.54,0:05:48.54,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,We're married now. What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:52.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I-I'll make some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:01.72,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Something's definitely off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:05.01,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Some of the cookies \NI baked are missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.01,0:06:07.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sure there were ten of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.42,0:06:09.52,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Last night, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.96,0:06:13.16,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I wasn't mistaken when \NI thought some had disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.66,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:19.25,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose, is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.49,0:06:22.47,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. Your cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:29.14,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,And none of us would have taken them \Nwithout permission, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:32.61,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Could it have been the forest fairies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:37.13,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But I can't imagine the fairies \Njust taking them without asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:38.85,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,True...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:51.15,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,What? The sweets you made \Nare disappearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.15,0:06:52.38,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,We don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:55.73,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,If we took any without asking, \Nthe king would be mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:57.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:07:01.36,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Do you know if there are any spells \Nthat could make cookies disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:05.95,Default,Forest Fairy3,0,0,0,,Hmm... We don't know \Nany mean magic like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:08.49,Default,Forest Fairy4,0,0,0,,We only like fun things!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:10.17,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes, that's true, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:14.50,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you all. \NWould you like to have these?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.91,0:07:17.13,Default,Forest Fairy1,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.13,0:07:19.29,Default,Forest Fairy2,0,0,0,,Yes! We'd love to have them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:26.82,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,So... I wonder what I should do...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.82,0:07:28.45,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Indeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:32.06,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Why not try asking Prince Aquasteed?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:35.33,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua is very busy \Nwith his official duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:39.56,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I can't trouble him with something \Nas silly as disappearing cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.12,0:07:45.25,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:47.80,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.64,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm a bit late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:50.57,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.95,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You've been working very hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:07:59.99,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Did anything happen today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.99,0:08:04.76,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No. I was fitted for a dress \Nand made some sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:12.18,Flashback,Aquasteed FB,0,0,0,,Strange things are happening \Nin Tiara's vicinity?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:16.01,Flashback,Tarmo FB,0,0,0,,Yes. It's unclear whether \Nanyone wishes her harm,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.01,0:08:19.39,Flashback,Tarmo FB,0,0,0,,but Philine informed me \Nthat we should remain alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:25.46,Flashback,Tarmo FB,0,0,0,,And... it seems Lady Tiararose \Nwas reluctant to speak to you about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.53,0:08:29.74,Flashback,Aquasteed FB,0,0,0,,I see. That's just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:34.12,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Honestly, she's just too precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.12,0:08:36.48,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,How can I get her to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:39.00,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:44.00,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:46.26,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,What is it, Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:49.01,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Th-That face! He totally knows!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:54.01,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,He's going to pamper me until \NI tell him what happened today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:59.48,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Th-The truth is, earlier today...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.77,0:09:02.23,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Aw, you're caving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.06,0:09:07.51,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Please don't act so disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.51,0:09:10.38,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I was all set to use this \Nopportunity to pamper you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:13.53,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Disappearing cookies, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:18.34,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It makes more sense to believe this is \Nthe work of fairies rather than humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.34,0:09:21.04,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:24.39,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,the forest fairies would never do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.24,0:09:29.13,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'll look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.13,0:09:31.87,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.87,0:09:35.32,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But aren't you already busy with work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:39.53,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,A few of my cookies \Ndisappearing isn't a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.53,0:09:43.90,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes, it is. \NYour cookies belong to me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:46.44,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, honestly! Even my cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:47.83,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You're awfully greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:48.96,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.35,0:09:56.04,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,The moment I made you mine, I decided \NI wasn't going to hold back anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:59.54,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,So don't worry. \NJust leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:02.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:26.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.40,0:10:47.15,Default,Sea Fairy1,0,0,0,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:49.09,Default,Sea Fairy2,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:51.55,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,You brought those sweets here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.55,0:10:54.23,Default,Sea Fairy1,0,0,0,,Well, Icilla just seems so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.23,0:10:56.51,Default,Sea Fairy2,0,0,0,,She always seemed so happy before,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:10:58.78,Default,Sea Fairy2,0,0,0,,but now she almost never smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:10:59.83,Default,Sea Fairy1,0,0,0,,Want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.18,0:11:02.15,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Throw that thing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:05.34,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,I dislike sweets made by humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.54,0:11:08.23,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Love is worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.83,0:11:22.95,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:30.42,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Something on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:32.25,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:37.55,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It just seems so strange since \NI know the sea fairies don't like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:41.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm happy they want to eat my sweets,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:43.32,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,but it's a complicated feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:48.25,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe \Nthey'd do this to harass her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:52.77,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I hope Lady Icilla will know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:57.80,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,There's no one in this country \Nthe sea fairies love more than her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:00.66,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:02.11,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.19,0:12:06.62,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,His Highness has told me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:10.83,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry to make you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.83,0:12:14.84,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You were the only one we could \Nthink of who might be able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:21.33,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm not sure where I should start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.19,0:12:26.52,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,If there's anything you \Nknow, please tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:36.31,Flashback Italics,Icilla FB INT,0,0,0,,I never knew rejection \Ncould hurt this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:40.34,Flashback Italics,Icilla FB INT,0,0,0,,I promised I'd give them my blessing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.52,Flashback Italics,Icilla FB INT,0,0,0,,but I just can't stop crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.14,0:12:46.15,Default,Sea Fairy1,0,0,0,,Icilla is sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:47.83,Default,Sea Fairy2,0,0,0,,That makes us sad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:53.00,Default,Sea Fairy3,0,0,0,,Let's go bully that Tiararose lady \Nwho took her true love from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:54.13,Default,Sea Fairy1/2,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.49,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,I could never tell them that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.49,0:13:04.85,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,I don't want to hurt them or make them \Nworry about things they shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.28,0:13:07.10,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:09.43,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:13.44,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'll go see the Sea Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:16.85,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,We've never met before,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:19.41,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,but I know how to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.41,0:13:24.00,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You're going to ask the Sea Fairy King \Nto make things right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:27.70,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Yes. Could you give me just \Na little bit of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:31.33,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,All right. We'll be counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.75,0:13:33.33,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:36.75,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,This has turned into \Na bigger matter than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:42.50,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to trouble you \Nwith something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:49.18,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:55.98,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm the reason the sea fairies \Nstole your cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:14:00.49,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What? It was because of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:03.49,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Yes... because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.52,0:14:11.96,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:16.50,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:19.42,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:22.71,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You don't need \Nto force yourself to tell us,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:25.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,so please don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.75,0:14:29.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It hasn't caused any trouble for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:32.06,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I can just make more cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.37,0:14:40.47,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Thank you for understanding my \Ndifficulty in telling you the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.47,0:14:44.08,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I promise I will see the Sea Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:49.53,Default,LadyA,0,0,0,,These desserts are delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:52.04,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:53.45,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.45,0:14:55.40,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose's tea parties
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.40,0:14:59.54,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,are known among noble ladies \Nas "forest tea parties."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:05.35,Default,LadyA,0,0,0,,Because everyone living in Marinforest \Nadmires you, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.35,0:15:07.36,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,That includes us, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:08.80,Default,Three,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:10.72,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:15.23,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm also happy to have this opportunity \Nto talk to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.86,0:15:23.19,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm in the world of an otome game,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:26.27,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,but it has a history going back \Nto the very distant past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.27,0:15:27.86,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's so interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:32.08,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It makes me realize that even though \Nit was a game, it's still reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:35.76,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and that I really am living my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:52.19,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.07,0:15:56.31,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, I never knew there was \Nsuch an age in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:15:59.99,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What's this? Did you see \Nsomething interesting in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.99,0:16:02.74,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes, there were \Ndessert-baking competitions...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.34,0:16:04.03,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:09.19,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.61,0:16:12.22,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I didn't sense anyone there at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:16.64,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Tarmo is still standing guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.97,0:16:20.26,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Is it possible to get so close \Nwithout anyone noticing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:23.76,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What a pretty lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:27.30,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Wh-What's the right way to speak to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.61,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Um... and you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.61,0:16:32.18,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. I haven't introduced myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.71,0:16:36.18,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I am Claire, the Sky Fairy King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.96,0:16:40.79,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! Where are my manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:45.63,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,My name is Tiararose Lapis Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:49.09,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Come now, there's \Nno need to be so formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.09,0:16:50.72,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:01.31,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Would you like to have some?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:03.71,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Thank you! I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.71,0:17:06.55,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I've prepared tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.55,0:17:07.96,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:11.76,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I baked these. They're cheese tarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:14.95,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,They look delicious. I love cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.20,0:17:21.27,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yes, they are delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:22.78,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:27.65,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I knew Prince Aqua had received \Nthe blessing of the sky, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:31.91,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I came to see Aquasteed's princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.91,0:17:33.27,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.27,0:17:39.10,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What will I do if the Sky Fairy King \Nbrands me as unworthy of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:43.89,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's all right. I'm not going to eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.89,0:17:46.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry... I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.81,0:17:50.55,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's all right. I'm the one \Nwho dropped in unannounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:54.76,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,But I'm glad to see that Aquasteed's \Nprincess is such a nice girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:18:00.46,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Your magic is in these, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.46,0:18:02.57,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's strange, but it feels comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:07.27,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm embarrassed to admit it, \Nbut magic is not my strongest suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.27,0:18:12.74,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The only thing I'm good at is \Nputting a bit of it into my desserts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:17.12,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Fairies don't particularly \Nneed to eat, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.45,0:18:21.45,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,So I envy you for being able to \Nmake such delicious treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:27.63,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to help you \Nat any time, if you'll have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.49,0:18:32.53,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,And I'll make some delicious \Nsweets for you, King Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.23,0:18:35.14,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You're so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.14,0:18:38.00,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll take you up on that offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:41.43,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I was hoping to find some female friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:43.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:49.27,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,After that, King Claire started \Nattending my tea parties often, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:53.33,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Honestly, Aquasteed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:55.95,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I was finally enjoying some \Ngirls-only time with Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:18:58.51,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's ruined when there's a boy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:00.00,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You're one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:03.55,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm happy for the opportunity \Nto have tea with both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:05.79,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Aw, Tiararose!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.17,0:19:07.78,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You're so sweet and honest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:12.49,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua, this is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:15.48,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You look happy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.47,0:19:19.24,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Gosh, you two are so lovey-dovey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:21.72,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's not fair that Aquasteed \Ngets all the attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:24.80,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Don't get any closer to Tiara \Nthan necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:27.23,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Then I'll have less of my cute Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:28.96,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:33.23,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,If you keep tying her down like that, \Nshe'll get sick of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:35.24,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:38.30,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara is precious to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:40.24,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'll never let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.61,0:19:42.15,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:48.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't say such embarrassing \Nthings in front of King Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.92,0:20:03.93,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,The waves are more intense than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:06.78,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,Something really is off with the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.36,0:20:10.75,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,I thought it seemed to look \Nmurkier than usual at times,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.75,0:20:12.44,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,but I thought I was imagining it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.31,0:20:17.55,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,How could this have happened \Nwhile I was watching over the seas?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:35.25,Italics,Icilla INT,0,0,0,,There's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:50.99,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:53.47,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,the Fairy King's chamber?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:06.30,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Welcome, Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:10.36,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I-It's an honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.68,0:21:13.23,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,My name is Icilla Pearllant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.23,0:21:15.75,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Yes, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:18.76,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Now, what is your business here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:22.82,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, Your Majesty. \NWith all due respect...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:25.15,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,it's about Crown Princess \NTiararose Lapis Marinforest,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.15,0:21:29.25,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,the wife of the crown prince \Nof my homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.53,0:21:32.02,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.43,0:21:40.28,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Wh-Why would you do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:41.39,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.77,0:21:44.39,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,That should be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:49.47,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,I absolutely hate Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.91,0:21:51.13,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:39.94,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&HFC8A3D&\blur4\bord1\b1\c&HB36BF7&\pos(313,124)}Whisper{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}That You {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Love{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Me
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.93,0:23:39.94,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&HFC8A3D&\bord1.75\b1\c&HB36BF7&\pos(313,124)}Whisper{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}That You {\c&HFC8A3D&\b1}Love{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.89,0:23:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua's cold gaze, his cold voice...\NI can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.00,0:23:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Prince Aqua, look at me.
